#HELPS
1 SEYDA NEEN~
Seyda Neen is a small marshbound port commonly known as Vvardenfell's gateway,
where timber homes, Imperial offices and muddy paths rise above dark wetlands.
The Grand Pharos watches the harbor as visitors arrive under Hlaalu governance
and silt striders wait beyond the village for inland journeys.~
